A playbook may declare a graph and no run state at all. There is nothing to report, so the command
refuses rather than printing an empty `states:` mapping.

-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-graphonly/playbook.md --
---
name: fx-graphonly
title: Graph Only
summary: No states declared.
graph:
  only: []
---

Preamble.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-graphonly/only/prompt.md --
---
summary: Do the only step.
---

Only body.
-- fixtures/cwd/run/.keep --
-- cmd --
booping playbook-state fx-graphonly --workdir run
-- exit --
1
